import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const h=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 500 | Module 2 Final: Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library Summary — The Civilizational Leap from Predation to Symbiosis","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 500 | Module 2 Final: Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library Summary — The Civilizational Leap from Predation to Symbiosis","no":500,"module":2,"tags":["Module 2 Final","Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Summary","Predation-to-Symbiosis","Civilizational Leap"],"related":["01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto","04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","05-Myriad-Ranks Joint-Advancement Basic Program"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0500_模块2-模块二终章-诸天对标批判库总结-从掠夺到共生的文明跃迁.md","filePath":"en/0500_模块2-模块二终章-诸天对标批判库总结-从掠夺到共生的文明跃迁.md"}'),o={name:"en/0500_模块2-模块二终章-诸天对标批判库总结-从掠夺到共生的文明跃迁.md"};function r(s,e,l,u,m,c){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-500-module-2-final-myriad-realms-benchmark-critique-library-summary-—-the-civilizational-leap-from-predation-to-symbiosis" tabindex="-1">Entry 500 | Module 2 Final: Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library Summary — The Civilizational Leap from Predation to Symbiosis <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-500-module-2-final-myriad-realms-benchmark-critique-library-summary-—-the-civilizational-leap-from-predation-to-symbiosis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 500 | Module 2 Final: Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library Summary — The Civilizational Leap from Predation to Symbiosis&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library (Final) | Review scope: Entries 251–500 | Benchmark base: Documents 01, 04, 05</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-250-critiques-one-sentence-summary" tabindex="-1">Introduction: 250 critiques, one sentence summary <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-250-critiques-one-sentence-summary" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: 250 critiques, one sentence summary&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Since Entry 251 established the general outline of &quot;Tang Luo system decomposition,&quot; Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library has continuously produced 250 entries (251–500): Tang Luo system (252–287), Shrouding the Heavens · Ye Fan (288–301), Douluo, Desolation Era · Ji Ning (406–431), Dragon Ball · Wukong (432–467), Infinite Terror · Zheng Zha (468–477), Jackie Chan Adventures (478–484), Dragon Rune · Gu Chensha (485–491), and cross-IP synthesis (492–499). This entry as Module 2&#39;s final condenses 250 critiques into one sentence: <strong>every predatory cosmos&#39;s root cause is &quot;betting civilization on one person&quot;; every symbiotic cosmos&#39;s prescription is &quot;writing civilization into institutions and networks.&quot;</strong></p><p>Heng Yuan Zhou (Myriad-Spirits Balanced-Anchor Origin Universe)&#39;s six top-level axioms — anti-predation axiom, republican axiom of Myriad Races, collective ascension axiom, causal self-discipline axiom, <strong>law-first axiom</strong>, universal equal infinite law as core — run through all 250 entries. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-250-entry-summary" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis (250-Entry Summary) <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-250-entry-summary" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis (250-Entry Summary)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>250 critiques point to the same energy-waste structure: <strong>civilization-grade energy compressed into one person&#39;s or a small circle&#39;s private property.</strong> Tang Luo&#39;s martial knowledge, Ye Fan&#39;s Great Emperor lineage, Ji Ning&#39;s transcendence path, Wukong&#39;s transformations, Zheng Zha&#39;s Genetic Lock, Jackie Chan&#39;s talismans, Gu Chensha&#39;s Tiandao Law — every share of energy that could have universally benefited Myriad Ranks ultimately was locked into one person or a small circle. This is the &quot;great material put to trivial use&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou repeatedly emphasizes.</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-250-entry-summary" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (250-Entry Summary) <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-250-entry-summary" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (250-Entry Summary)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>250 critiques summarize four regression paths (see Entry 496): single-point dependence, zeroing loop, zero-sum lock, class solidification. Tang Luo, Zheng Zha, Gu Chensha belong to the first; Main God Space belongs to the second; Jackie Chan Twelve Talismans belong to the third; Ye Fan, Shi Hao, Ji Ning belong to the fourth. Behind four paths is the same structure — <strong>civilization&#39;s key functions were not written into institutions, but bet on individuals.</strong> The individual falls, the function collapses.</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking-250-entry-summary" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking (250-Entry Summary) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking-250-entry-summary" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking (250-Entry Summary)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>250 entries summarize five predation modes (see Entry 493): Resource-Capture Type (Tang San), Position-Monopoly Type (Ye Fan, Shi Hao), Origin-Burning Type (Zheng Zha), Zero-Sum Contest Type (Jackie Chan), Gift-Bearing Type (Tang Luo, Gu Chensha). The five &quot;enlightened predators&quot; (Tang Luo, Ye Fan, Shi Hao, Ji Ning; see Entry 497) are the best because they are the mildest among five modes — but mild predation is still predation. All are short of the last step: <strong>turning oneself from &quot;the sole pillar&quot; into &quot;one of Myriad Ranks.&quot;</strong></p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative-250-entry-summary" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative (250-Entry Summary) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative-250-entry-summary" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative (250-Entry Summary)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>250 entries&#39; alternative ultimately condenses into six transformation modules (see Entry 498): cultivation system, knowledge system, governance system, distribution system, lineage system, law system. Each module replaces predatory status quo with symbiotic arrangement:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Predatory Status Quo</th><th>Symbiotic Arrangement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Spirit rings / Genetic Lock / Talismans / Tiandao Law</td><td>300 Origin systems</td></tr><tr><td>Knowledge privately hoarded</td><td>Alaya Network public</td></tr><tr><td>One-person decision</td><td>Three-layer governance</td></tr><tr><td>Zero-sum contest</td><td>Joint Contracting</td></tr><tr><td>Gift-style lineage</td><td>Every-Person-Path + 20% Activation</td></tr><tr><td>Plot-kidnapping setting</td><td>Law first</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan-250-entry-summary" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan (250-Entry Summary) <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan-250-entry-summary" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan (250-Entry Summary)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>250 entries all conclude with &quot;Quest Sediment Domain simulation review.&quot; Unified conclusion: any predatory cosmos, once injected with six transformation modules, its protagonist-uniqueness dependency drops from &quot;extremely high / high / medium&quot; to &quot;extremely low&quot;; self-consistency rises from &quot;medium-low / low&quot; to &quot;high&quot;; civilization no longer collapses under protagonist absence. <strong>From predation to symbiosis is not a moral choice, it is an engineering choice — the construction blueprint is already drawn.</strong></p><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment-250-entry-summary" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment (250-Entry Summary) <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment-250-entry-summary" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment (250-Entry Summary)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>250 entries repeatedly return to the same sentence: <strong>retcon-ending&#39;s root cause is law not first.</strong> Douluo spirit-ring dilution, Shrouding realm collapse, Dragon Ball transformation no-cap, Infinite Terror truth nesting-doll, Dragon Rune no-ceiling inflation — five forms of plot-kidnapping-setting (see Entry 494), all because law was not established at the very front. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s nine-plus-two-realms framework proves: a cosmos can infinitely expand without inflation, premise is <strong>law precedes plot; setting precedes combat power.</strong></p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: 250 entries jointly prove predatory cosmoses&#39; energy waste is structural, not accidental</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: all five predation modes opposed by Heng Yuan Zhou</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo is predatory school&#39;s ceiling, also closest to symbiosis — he takes the last step, it is Heng Yuan Zhou</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: 250 entries repeatedly point out predatory IPs all stop at human race or small circle; symbiotic cosmos covers 99% Myriad Ranks</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: only a law-first cosmos can infinitely expand without collapse</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power inherent in all; easygoing retain guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin eliminates predation motive</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>From Entry 251 to Entry 500, 250 critiques have walked a complete road: <strong>starting from Tang Luo&#39;s &quot;old-era universal-benefit ceiling,&quot; through per-entry dismantling of Shrouding, Douluo, Desolation Era, Dragon Ball, Infinite Terror, Jackie Chan Adventures, Dragon Rune, finally returning to Heng Yuan Zhou — not returning to a protagonist, but returning to an institution.</strong></p><p>On this road, we have seen the greatest good deed (Gu Chensha bearing sins for all beings), also the cruelest structure (Main God Space reincarnation harvest); we have seen the most passionate battle (Wukong), also the gentlest predation (Tang Luo&#39;s universal benefit). But 250 entries finally say only one sentence:</p><blockquote><p><strong>A truly great civilization is not held up by the greatest protagonist, but by institutions that let all protagonists step down in peace.</strong></p></blockquote><p>Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library closes here. Starting from the next entry, we enter Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain — no longer criticizing old cosmoses, but building a new one.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./251_模块2-唐罗体系拆解-总论三重上限与主角唯一性评判.html">Entry 251 · Tang Luo Overview</a> · <a href="./492_模块2-跨IP综合-主角唯一性依赖度五级标准总览.html">Entry 492 · Five-Level Standard</a> · <a href="./498_模块2-跨IP综合-锚点共生替代方案总览-六大模块的系统改造.html">Entry 498 · Six Transformation Modules</a> · <a href="./499_模块2-跨IP综合-法则优先公理的普适性-为何所有IP都需要法则先行.html">Entry 499 · Law-First Universality</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/01-锚点共生文明宣言.html">01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const y=i(o,[["render",r]]);export{h as __pageData,y as default};
